{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05294","headline":"奉和九日幸临渭亭登高应制得亭字 · 杨廉","name":"奉和九日幸临渭亭登高应制得亭字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远目瞰秦垧，重阳坐灞亭。\n既开黄菊酒，还降紫微星。\n箫鼓谙仙曲，山河入画屏。\n幸兹陪宴喜，无以效丹青。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨廉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05294.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05294","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}